休息与赛程：
home_rest_days, away_rest_days
home/away_match_density_mom_5
home/away_match_density_ewm_5

旅行与疲劳：
home_travel_km_team
away_travel_fatigue_score
home/away_travel_km_mom_5
home/away_travel_km_ewm_5
home/away_travel_fatigue_mom_5

rest_days
= 当前比赛日期 - 该队上一场比赛日期

match_density_mom_5
= 该队当前比赛前最近 5 场的 match_density 平均值

match_density_ewm_5
= 该队当前比赛前 match_density 的 EWM 指数加权均值，span=5

home_travel_km_team
= 当前比赛主队旅行距离，默认 0

away_travel_fatigue_score
= log1p(客队当前旅行距离) × (1 + 客队当前赛程密度) / sqrt(客队休息天数 + 1)

travel_km_mom_5
= 该队当前比赛前最近 5 场旅行距离平均值

travel_km_ewm_5
= 该队当前比赛前旅行距离 EWM，span=5

travel_fatigue_mom_5
= 该队当前比赛前最近 5 场 fatigue score 平均值